# 统一文本文件行尾为 LF（对齐 OpenHarmony/ArkTS 官方工程规范）
# - text=auto：git 自动识别文本/二进制，仅文本参与行尾转换
# - eol=lf：无论提交方系统（Windows/macOS/Linux）一律以 LF 入库与检出，
#   避免 Windows 检出 CRLF 导致工具链（如 bbcode-ts 快照比较）行尾误报
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源显式声明，防止误判为文本
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.hap binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.aac binary
*.flac binary
